{"s":100,"v":[{"t":"By the racers, panting,","w":[["وَٱلْعَـٰدِيَـٰتِ","By the racers","wal-ʿādiyāti","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["عَـٰدِيَـٰتِ",3840]]],["ضَبْحًۭا","panting","ḍabḥan",""]]},{"t":"And the producers of sparks [when] striking","w":[["فَٱلْمُورِيَـٰتِ","And the producers of sparks","fal-mūriyāti","",[["فَ",7],["ٱلْ",2],["مُورِيَـٰتِ",4471]]],["قَدْحًۭا","striking","qadḥan",""]]},{"t":"And the chargers at dawn,","w":[["فَٱلْمُغِيرَٰتِ","And the chargers","fal-mughīrāti","",[["فَ",7],["ٱلْ",2],["مُغِيرَٰتِ",4407]]],["صُبْحًۭا","(at) dawn","ṣub'ḥan",""]]},{"t":"Stirring up thereby [clouds of] dust,","w":[["فَأَثَرْنَ","Then raise","fa-atharna","",[["فَ",7],["أَثَرْ",1257],["نَ",52]]],["بِهِۦ","thereby","bihi","",[["بِ",10],["هِۦ",5]]],["نَقْعًۭا","dust","naqʿan",""]]},{"t":"Arriving thereby in the center collectively,","w":[["فَوَسَطْنَ","Then penetrate (in the) center","fawasaṭna","",[["فَ",7],["وَسَطْ",4628],["نَ",52]]],["بِهِۦ","thereby","bihi","",[["بِ",10],["هِۦ",5]]],["جَمْعًا","collectively","jamʿan",""]]},{"t":"Indeed mankind, to his Lord, is ungrateful.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed","inna",""],["ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ","mankind","l-insāna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["إِنسَـٰنَ",181]]],["لِرَبِّهِۦ","to his Lord","lirabbihi","",[["لِ",8],["رَبِّ",24],["هِۦ",5]]],["لَكَنُودٌۭ","(is) surely ungrateful","lakanūdun","",[["لَ",23],["كَنُودٌۭ",4063]]]]},{"t":"And indeed, he is to that a witness.","w":[["وَإِنَّهُۥ","And indeed, he","wa-innahu","",[["وَ",1],["إِنَّ",15],["هُۥ",5]]],["عَلَىٰ","on","ʿalā",""],["ذَٰلِكَ","that","dhālika","",[["ذَٰ",32],["لِ",0],["كَ",0]]],["لَشَهِيدٌۭ","surely (is) a witness","lashahīdun","",[["لَ",23],["شَهِيدٌۭ",221]]]]},{"t":"And indeed he is, in love of wealth, intense.","w":[["وَإِنَّهُۥ","And indeed he","wa-innahu","",[["وَ",1],["إِنَّ",15],["هُۥ",5]]],["لِحُبِّ","in (the) love","liḥubbi","",[["لِ",8],["حُبِّ",890]]],["ٱلْخَيْرِ","(of) wealth","l-khayri","",[["ٱلْ",2],["خَيْرِ",78]]],["لَشَدِيدٌ","(is) surely intense","lashadīdun","",[["لَ",23],["شَد